1	Query_1[1]	Specific	active site	D133-135,M136-138,D139-141,G142-144,T145-147,T235-237,G238-240,K676-678,G742-744,D745-747,A748-750,N754-756,D757-759	13	0	319818
1	Query_1[1]	Specific	HAD signature motif I	D133-135,M136-138,D139-141,G142-144,T145-147	5	0	319818
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
SESSION	2	blastp	2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
